import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 350 | Perfect-Work Anchor Symbiosis Alternative: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 350 | Perfect-Work Anchor Symbiosis Alternative: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution","no":350,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Anchor Symbiosis","Alternative","Emperor-Immortal Institution","Republicanization"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Power Checks","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","17-Plane Transcendent Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0350_模块2-完美世界-仙帝制度的共和化改造.md","filePath":"en/0350_模块2-完美世界-仙帝制度的共和化改造.md"}'),n={name:"en/0350_模块2-完美世界-仙帝制度的共和化改造.md"};function a(s,e,l,m,h,u){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-350-perfect-work-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-republicanizing-the-emperor-immortal-institution" tabindex="-1">Entry 350 | Perfect-Work Anchor Symbiosis Alternative: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-350-perfect-work-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-republicanizing-the-emperor-immortal-institution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 350 | Perfect-Work Anchor Symbiosis Alternative: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 27 · Alternative) | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 03, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-how-many-steps-to-transform-emperor-immortal-dictatorship-into-myriad-ranks-republicanism" tabindex="-1">Introduction: How many steps to transform &quot;Emperor-Immortal dictatorship&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks republicanism&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-how-many-steps-to-transform-emperor-immortal-dictatorship-into-myriad-ranks-republicanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: How many steps to transform &quot;Emperor-Immortal dictatorship&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks republicanism&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous 26 entries critiqued Perfect World&#39;s single-log civilization. From this entry the turn to construction begins: what Heng Yuan Zhou asks is not &quot;where Perfect World went wrong,&quot; but &quot;if Anchor Symbiosis is injected, how should the Emperor-Immortal institution be republicanized.&quot; This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to give the reform blueprint. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>before reform = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency; post-reform target = extremely low / networked</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-pre-reform-diagnosis" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Pre-Reform Diagnosis) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-pre-reform-diagnosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Pre-Reform Diagnosis)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before reform, the Emperor-Immortal institution&#39;s energy waste: the Emperor Immortal alone carries eternity, Myriad Ranks excluded from governance. The first step of reform is to divert the governance power pressed on the Emperor Immortal&#39;s shoulder to the institutional network.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-pre-reform-diagnosis" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Pre-Reform Diagnosis) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-pre-reform-diagnosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Pre-Reform Diagnosis)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dictatorial institutions regress because the person gone, policy dies. The core of republican reform is to make order not tie to any one Emperor Immortal.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-pre-reform-diagnosis" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Pre-Reform Diagnosis) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-pre-reform-diagnosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Pre-Reform Diagnosis)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor Immortal takes power by force. The key to reform is changing &quot;who is strongest who rules&quot; to &quot;who passes assessment who takes the post.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core" tabindex="-1">IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor-Immortal institution&#39;s republican reform takes four steps:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Reform Step</th><th>Old Emperor-Immortal System</th><th>Republicanized Reform</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Legislation</td><td>Emperor Immortal&#39;s single word decides</td><td>Anchor Council collective legislation</td></tr><tr><td>Administration</td><td>Emperor Immortal personally handles</td><td>Symbiotic Executive Committee division-of-labor administration</td></tr><tr><td>Judiciary</td><td>Strong one = adjudicator</td><td>Symbiotic Court independent judiciary</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision</td><td>None</td><td>Anchor Supervisory Committee multi-layer supervision</td></tr></tbody></table><p>An Emperor-Immortal-tier strong one like Shi Hao is not deposed, but enters posts through the &quot;Plane Transcendent four-dimension assessment&quot; (Power 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15) — his strength used for institutional construction, not alone autocratic. After reform, Myriad Ranks may still look up to Shi Hao, yet need no longer bet eternity on his one shoulder.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the Emperor-Immortal dictatorship original model</li><li>Inject republican reform parameters</li><li>Cross-era deduction of civilization resilience</li><li>Output &quot;Emperor-Immortal Institution Republicanization Reform Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Pre-reform self-consistency: medium-low; post-reform target: high (law-preceded)</strong></li><li><strong>Pre-reform retcon risk: high; post-reform target: zero</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: drops from extreme-leaning-medium to extremely low</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: republican reform does not abolish Shi Hao, but gives him a post he need not alone carry. After reform, Shi Hao is still the strongest fighter, but his military exploits are converted through the Anchor Council into laws, not dissipated with his exit. This is the most dignified placement of a hero — let his greatness leave institutions, not an empty city that needs him present at all times.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Emperor-Immortal energy diverted to institutional construction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: taking power by force changed to assessment-posting</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo did not even institutionalize the academy; this entry gives a complete republican path</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks enter the four steps of legislation, administration, judiciary, supervision</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: republican institutions can replicate to the multiverse</li></ul><p>Add one more layer: the hardest part of republican reform is making the strongest willing to hand over power. Heng Yuan Zhou does not rely on moral persuasion, but on four-dimension assessment — if a strong one wants to stay in post, he must continuously meet contribution and responsibility standards, otherwise the institution automatically cedes the seat to successors.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-republicanizing-the-emperor-immortal-institution" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-republicanizing-the-emperor-immortal-institution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Republicanizing the Emperor-Immortal Institution&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor-Immortal institution&#39;s republican reform is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core alternative to the Perfect-Work system. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization sets no one-person-rule Emperor-Immortal seat, but a Myriad-Ranks Republican Council plus a Transcendent post system. The law-first axiom ensures every post is charter-bound; the Alaya Network does compliance review on all decisions. The universal equal infinite law means the power position of &quot;Emperor Immortal&quot; itself should be abolished, not have another person sit on it.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-three-stages-of-republican-reform" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Three Stages of Republican Reform <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-three-stages-of-republican-reform" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Three Stages of Republican Reform&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Emperor-Immortal institution&#39;s republican reform takes three stages: stage one, decompose Emperor-Immortal power into three independent functions — network supervision, deliberative decision, security; stage two, each functional module taken over by post-holders elected by Myriad-Rank representatives; stage three, the Alaya Network takes over routine operation, humans (and Myriad-Rank beings) only participate in deliberation at major decisions. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s law-first axiom ensures every stage is charter-reviewed. The universal equal infinite law is the rights foundation throughout the reform.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Republican reform is not negating Shi Hao, but letting his greatness need not come at the price of &quot;alone carrying eternity.&quot; After reform, Perfect World still has the legend of the Desolate Heaven Emperor, but the night of eternity is guarded together by Myriad Ranks.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · republicanization of the Emperor-Immortal institution described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./335_模块2-完美世界-个人独裁与文明押注.html">Entry 335 · Emperor-Immortal Institution Critique</a> · <a href="./353_模块2-完美世界-锚点共生注入完美世界.html">Entry 353 · Institutional Alternative Benefit</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Power Checks</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const p=t(n,[["render",a]]);export{d as __pageData,p as default};
